  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">COVID-19: M&#x101;ori /Pacific Tourism Partnership - Aho Rua / Va&apos;a tele</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A long-term M&#x101;ori&#xa0;/ Pacific tourism partnership, led by New Zealand M&#x101;ori Tourism.
M&#x101;ori expertise in cultivating world class indigenous and nature-based visitor experiences in New Zealand supports Pacific tourism development.&#xa0; M&#x101;ori indigenous values of kotahitanga (common purpose) and mahi tahi (collaboration) assists Pacific destinations to further differentiate their visitor destinations and experiences, returns are improved as Pacific visitor experiences move up the value chain.</narrative>
  </description>
